  "applies_to": "Daikin Applied Europe EWWQ-KC units with the POL486.65 controller running the Nayda software, including master/slave groups of up to four units.",
  "summary": "The EWWQ-KC units run the Nayda software on a POL486.65 controller. BACnet IP is a software option on the Ethernet port, enabled with connectivity kit EKRSCBMS. The list covers unit enable, mode and cool/heat setpoints, water temperatures, two circuits with one compressor each, evaporator and condenser pump data including variable-speed pump settings, and master/slave load and state objects.",
