  "firmware": "Nayda 1.00.A",
  "default_device_instance": null,
  "access_inferred": false,
  "notes": [
    "AV 151 is printed for both MSCtrlTmp and EvapVPF'FixSpeedSetpt2; the object without a confirmed instance is listed without one.",
    "Slave load/state and comm-error objects only apply to master/slave (multi-unit) installations.",
    "Slave State #1 (MV 1154) lists 3 for both Alarm and ComErr in the guide; it is kept as printed.",
    "Daikin France (Easyspec) publishes this guide as a PDF inside a zip together with the Modbus guide."
